ome from Ammer?",0],["dialogues","r503892","Greetings! I'm glad to see you in this lovely place. I'm Orphus. I…",0],["dialogues","r503895","Would you like to participate in the elven concert?",0],["dialogues","r503896","May your day be good, friend!",0],["dialogues","r503899","Are you here for the concert?",0],["dialogues","r503900","Aho, frriend! May the ancestorrs bless you.",0],["dialogues","r503902","Do you want to take part, too?",0],["dialogues","r503903","Greetings, comrade!",0],["dialogues","r503921","Where did you go next?",0],["dialogues","r503922","Ugh... Let me catch my breath. I'm tired of running after these…",0],["dialogues","r504014","Does it mean you're in charge of all vampires?",0],["dialogues","r504104","I think you need a break, Triss. Return to the residence.",0],["dialogues","r504105","Hello, hello!",0],["dialogues","r504171","Rosan, I need to be alone. Wait for me at the residence.",0],["dialogues","r504187","But, what if... Wait, no...",0],["dialogues","r504241","Aquila, I don't need you anymore. Return to the residence.",0],["dialogues","r504253","Ah... What do you want?",0],["dialogues","r504355","Grim, I would like you to go. Return to the residence.",0],["dialogues","r504366","What are you up to?",0],["dialogues","r504423","Lea, you can go. Return to your House.",0],["dialogues","r504444","It's so beautiful here, isn't it?",0],["dialogues","r504488","Lier, I need to be alone. Return to the residence.",0],["dialogues","r504500","What is it?",0],["dialogues","r504552","Elia, I don't need you anymore. Return to the residence.",0],["dialogues","r504559","I'm listening.",0]]